  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HBT N&#xe4;tverk Sydasien/RFSU 2008-2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia LGBT Network 2008-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A regional programme covering four years has been developed by RFSU   in cooperation with LGBT (Lesbian, Gay, Bisexual and Transgender)     organisations in the South Asia Region. It  aims to support civil     society organisations in South Asia to improve rights and health      including HIV situation for LGBT person in the South Asia region.     2008-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett regionalt program som omfattar fyra &#xe5;r har utvecklats av RFSU i   samarbete med HBT (homosexuella, bisexuella och transpersoner)        organisationer i s&#xf6;dra Asien regionen. Det syftar till att st&#xf6;dja     civila samh&#xe4;llets organisationer i s&#xf6;dra Asien f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra      r&#xe4;ttigheter och h&#xe4;lsa, inklusive hiv situation f&#xf6;r HBT personer i     s&#xf6;dra Asien. 2008-2011</narrative>
  </description>
